2026-09-16T23:46:38.962+00:00 dispatch_start tool dispatch started {"tool_name": "task_complete", "phase": "repair", "arguments": {"message": "The bug in debounce.ts was that when a new call arrived while a timer was still pending, the function returned early without cancelling the pending setTimeout. This meant fn would still fire after waitMs even though a newer call was made, defeating debounce. The corrected version cancels the pending call (clearTimeout + reset timer), reschedules with the latest arguments using spread (...args), and passes them to fn. The self-test verifies that a second call cancels the pending call and reschedules with latest args. Verification: node debounce.ts printed \"all tests passed\"."}, "requested_tool_name": null}
